; FD-78 guard fixture (prune-dead-storage-image-types): a format-less
; storage image type whose only wrapper is a Uniform pointer type
; (id %7) referenced by NOTHING except a helper OpFunction whose
; FunctionControl mask word numerically equals the wrapper's id. The
; prune's raw-word liveness scan counted the leading literal, so the
; wrapper (and through it the image type) survived; the operand-aware
; scan (operandRefIds) counts only OpFunction's function-type id.
OpCapability Shader
OpCapability StorageImageWriteWithoutFormat
OpMemoryModel Logical GLSL450
OpEntryPoint Fragment %main "main"
OpExecutionMode %main OriginUpperLeft
%void = OpTypeVoid
%fn = OpTypeFunction %void
%float = OpTypeFloat 32
%uint = OpTypeInt 32 0
%img = OpTypeImage %float 2D 0 0 0 2 Unknown
%ptr = OpTypePointer Uniform %img
%main = OpFunction %void None %fn
%l = OpLabel
OpReturn
OpFunctionEnd
%helper = OpFunction %void Inline|DontInline|Pure %fn
%hl = OpLabel
OpReturn
OpFunctionEnd
